e":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"rnXMM1jS9BMFabndBC-bkw","review_id":"rpisnr9daxn4vUgGObRGXw","date":"2011-03-09T06:44:38","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9362066984176636,"text_excerpt":"I never thought I'd enjoy a pizza with what seems like a cacophony of toppings, but Reginelli's has convinced me otherwise. The Tony's Play specialty pie is one of my hands-down favorites in town, with its mix of salty cured meats, veggies, and capers, which are a surprising complement to the other toppings on this pie. Other than pizzas, the salads at Reginelli's are also great, if not a bit on the pricey side. The chicken salad, with a citrusy vinaigrette and the bite of gorgonzola, is fantastic. Pastas are less stellar in my book, but I personally don't enjoy such spicy, assertive sauces. Calzones I've had were a bit bland, and heavy on ricotta. The appetizers are in most cases a good ..."},{"business_id":"rnXMM1jS9BMFabndBC-bkw","review_id":"gQzm2KaFIAueC3T8iT3Ihg","date":"2017-02-11T20:32:25","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9272321462631226,"text_excerpt":"The food here is so delicious. I highly recommend the spinach and artichoke dip, honestly the best spinach dip I've had from anywhere. The pizza is tasty too, the crust is nice and fluffy but still crisp. The sandwiches are delicious as well. Overall a very nice atmosphere and clean. The parking lot is small so parking is sometimes a hassle. Other than that, we keep coming back."},{"business_id":"rnXMM1jS9BMFabndBC-bkw","review_id":"1WXcYgiZ0df1xqkMeJ3P-g","date":"2013-10-28T07:36:50","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9272311925888062,"text_excerpt":"How does a place with years of awards only have 3.5 stars on here? Honestly, I'm just glad to be back in a pizza town. I don't eat it often, but when I do it's not gonna be Pizza Hut or Dominos. Houston was severely lacking in tasty pizza options. I went with Mom last week for a late lunch. Walked in and we both immediately commented on how delicious it smelled. We had a great waitress- very attentive, fairly personable. Cheese bread \"stix\" were sooo yummy. Neither of us cared for the dipping sauce, but they also don't need it. The thing that makes their pizza so great is the crust. Well the fresh (not fake processed) cheese makes it great too. I like that they have a variety of sauces- r..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"rnXMM1jS9BMFabndBC-bkw","photo_id":"9OGLw79_2tOnnFydeav7Lw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/9OGLw79_2tOnnFydeav7Lw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8792234659194946},{"business_id":"rnXMM1jS9BMFabndBC-bkw","photo_id":"KCf7sn2uEVKSaA8IhoMoiw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/KCf7sn2uEVKSaA8IhoMoiw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8708295822143555},{"business_id":"rnXMM1jS9BMFabndBC-bkw","photo_id":"CextxXHd8wAX8y3LwyrcMg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/CextxXHd8wAX8y3LwyrcMg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8660433292388916},{"business_id":"rnXMM1jS9BMFabndBC-bkw","photo_id":"QeiXD4sAnhL4mqZG6t_YgA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/QeiXD4sAnhL4mqZG6t_YgA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8586646914482117},{"business_id":"rnXMM1jS9BMFabndBC-bkw","photo_id":"LdVqqpUvOcVQFRkLsaEVSw","label":"food","imag